<title>BRAZIL: Brazil coffee to see rains, cloudy weather - Somar.</title>
<headline>Brazil coffee to see rains, cloudy weather - Somar.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's coffee regions are to see rainy, cloudy weather over the coming days with seasonal temperatures and no damaging cold in sight, local meteorologist Somar said.</p>
<p>A cold front which has arrived in the south of the country should bring showers to coffee regions over the weekend which will hit the harvest, Somar said.</p>
<p>The air mass associated with the cold front will not enter the country, moving out to the ocean further south.</p>
<p>No other air mass is forecast to enter the country in the next seven days, Somar said.</p>
<p>((-Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151))</p>
